WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.235
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.235 --> 00:00:04.704
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:04.704 --> 00:00:06.172
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:09.275
Today was Thanksgiving, the day
we all sit around the table

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:12.345
and think, "Which of these
cousins has weed?"

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:17.683
President Biden
and his family spent

00:00:17.683 --> 00:00:20.920
Thanksgiving on Nantucket
at the $39 million home

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:23.256
of private-equity
billionaire David Rubenstein.

00:00:23.256 --> 00:00:25.892
And even there, they won't
have enough normal chairs

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:27.527
for everybody.

00:00:29.762 --> 00:00:31.597
Today was the
Macy's Thanksgiving Day Parade,

00:00:31.597 --> 00:00:33.166
which featured
12 marching bands.

00:00:33.166 --> 00:00:35.468
Though the moment New Yorkers
saw them take out instruments,

00:00:35.468 --> 00:00:38.304
they all instinctively
put in AirPods.

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:41.975
That's right, today was the
Macy's Thanksgiving Day Parade,

00:00:41.975 --> 00:00:44.110
which featured
16 giant character balloons,

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:48.615
700 clowns,
and one very lost marathoner.

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:53.452
New York Mayor Adams made
a safety announcement yesterday

00:00:53.452 --> 00:00:55.821
for the Thanksgiving Day Parade,
where he assured New Yorkers

00:00:55.821 --> 00:00:59.025
that everything was perfectly
safe, except his job.

00:01:01.694 --> 00:01:04.964
Target is offering a full
Thanksgiving meal for $25,

00:01:04.964 --> 00:01:06.298
including a 10-pound turkey,

00:01:06.298 --> 00:01:09.035
potatoes, stuffing mix,
gravy, and cranberry sauce.

00:01:09.035 --> 00:01:11.404
The way it works is,
you go to the self-checkout

00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:13.873
and only scan the potatoes.

00:01:16.642 --> 00:01:19.111
According to new research,
belly fat may be linked

00:01:19.111 --> 00:01:21.280
to early stages
of Alzheimer's disease.

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:25.351
So now he's making a list and
checking it three, four times.

00:01:29.455 --> 00:01:32.825
"I think I've been to
this house."

00:01:32.825 --> 00:01:35.461
And, finally, according to AAA,
more than 55 million people

00:01:35.461 --> 00:01:37.930
are expected to travel
over the Thanksgiving holiday,

00:01:37.930 --> 00:01:40.533
even though more than
100 million bought tickets.

00:01:40.533 --> 00:01:44.370
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:47.273
We are very excited
to have you here tonight.

